CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'at91_gpio->ops == &at91sam9x5_ops'
#99: FILE: drivers/pinctrl/pinctrl-at91.c:1420:
+	if ((at91_gpio->ops == &at91sam9x5_ops) &&
+	    (readl_relaxed(pio + PIO_AIMMR) & mask) &&
+	    (readl_relaxed(pio + PIO_ELSR) & mask))

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

